\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. BE known to as in breaking bread,
\par But do not then depart;
\par Saviour, abide with us, and spread
\par Thy table in our heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. There sup with us in love divine;
\par Thy body and Thy blood,
\par That living bread, that heavenly wine,
\par Be our immortal food.
\par                      Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

